\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Construct Bane 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Construct Bane 2</a>:</b> This weapon is attuned specifically to disrupt creations, dealing an additional 2d10 bane damage vs. Constructs.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 7%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 7%</a>:</b> Passive: +7% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a> Bypass. (Fortification Bypass makes your attacks ignore a percentage of enemy Fortification.)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Shatterbow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Shatterbow.png/420px-Shatterbow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"475\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Shatterbow.png 1.5x\" /></a></sp